<title>USA: Gibson Greetings ex-CEO resigns from board.</title>
<headline>Gibson Greetings ex-CEO resigns from board.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gibson Greetings Inc said Friday that Benjamin Sottile, the company's former chief executive officer, had resigned from the board of directors.</p>
<p>Gibson said that as part of the resignation, it had reached an amicable agreement on the terms governing Sottile's 1996 termination of employment.</p>
<p>The company said accrual provisions were made at the time of his termination, and the settlement will not hurt its 1997 operating results.</p>
</text>
